  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reallocate GAP partner costs for 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a retrospective exercise to reallocate a number of 2023 costs of scoping and delivering the Global Advocacy Programme on Local Leadership of Crisis Response from the Humanitarian Policy team budget, to the correct budget for GAP activities (as proposed by James Steel).

Costs include:
- Charter4Change East Africa regional and global meeting in Kenya; linked to scoping East Africa regional and global GAP priorities (November 2023)
- Workshop and conference participation for partners in Colombia; contributing to shaping GAP plan for Colombia as priority context (November 2023)
- Workshop in Thailand for Myanmar partners to scope GAP Myanmar country-specific plan (December 2023)</narrative>
  </description>
